### List all mailboxes for the current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/mailboxes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List mails in a mailbox (replace {{mailboxId}} with actual id from the response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/mailboxes/{{mailboxId}}/mails HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get mail detail (replace {{mailId}} with actual id from the response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/mails/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark mail as read (replace {{mailId}} with actual id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/mails/{{mailId}}/read HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
